WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.236
[music playing]

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:10.176
I was being asked to
be John Gotti's hit man.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.646
If I refused, John
Gotti would kill me.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.316
I understood that.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:20.053
The key part of my plan
was to get Georgie Grasso

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.157
drunk on drugs to keep
him loose so there

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.559
was no problem killing him.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.166
I'm at the bar, and
Georgie Grasso walks in.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.634
I go, hey, Georgie.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.568
Come on.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.302
Come over.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.238
We're all having shots.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.339
And he goes, ah, just one.

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:40.306
I'm going to leave early.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.341
I told him, just have one shot.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:42.041
It ain't going to kill you.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.209
Have a shot.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:50.250
And once he puts down the first
one, inside me, I say, OK.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.286
I got him.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:56.089
Once I have Georgie
drunk and high,

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.491
he's going to want to
continue the partying.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.194
And I tell Georgie, go shotgun.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.363
I sit right behind
Georgie Grasso's seat,

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.332
because from there,
I'm going to choose

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.768
where I think is comfortable
to shoot him in the head.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:18.244
We're driving down
this quiet road.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:21.314
And he's laughing,
and I'm laughing.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:22.849
As we're having that
banter, somewhere

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.785
in the back of your
conscience, you're saying,

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.454
am I going to do this, really?

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.289
Am I going to take
this guy's life?

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:37.163
And the other side of me
is saying, you promised.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:41.367
You don't obey this
order, somebody I trust

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.802
is going to kill me, too.

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:47.740
And I'm nervous.

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.209
Can I really do this?

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:56.416
I put one into the chamber.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.685
Do it.

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.421
[radio chatter]

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.089
Don't do it.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.062
Just do it.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:12.599
He's going to get killed
one way or another.

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.434
I'm not getting
killed for this guy.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:21.140
I finally picked up the gun.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.775
I stuck it around the headrest.

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:28.915
And I just--

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:32.485
[gunshot]

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:46.032
Nobody said anything.

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.902
It kind of really hit me.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.404
Wow, this guy's gone.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:52.772
I really killed this guy.

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.914
As I look back on it,
that was the biggest

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.317
mistake I ever made in my life.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.519
You just killed yourself
with that bullet.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.888
Although you're
not in the ground,

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:11.591
you just destroyed your life.

